{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_050jul_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_050jul_2000_situation", "source_sha256": "d78d9346f5c0653a25db8dcdc4060906c0f789e8843cf0b4feae498b82c21828", "ja": "グラビア撮影　開始前", "zh": "写真摄影　开始前", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_050jul_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_050jul_2000_place", "source_sha256": "f1860edaa8a9578fc2484c89f70aff5f4be5b8e448a9efe39fa4812250ca02c2", "ja": "撮影スタジオ", "zh": "摄影棚", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_050jul_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_050jul_2001_050jul", "source_sha256": "8599061544c221c7e1f3bdb1bba81a13594530ee2609f1d3676bb8a806dffd10", "ja": "くぅ……。アイドルらしい衣装にも慣れてないのに、\n水着で撮影とか……ハードルが高すぎるだろ……。", "zh": "呜……连偶像风格的服装都还没习惯，\n就要穿泳装拍照……难度也太高了吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_050jul_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_050jul_2002_p", "source_sha256": "5004305a096f9a14b2504e604ffa4c3f32b0e1c5ed79eedefa6bacbc5fbe556c", "ja": "そう言うと思って、これを持ってきたぞ！", "zh": "我就知道你会这么说，所以带了这个来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_050jul_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_050jul_2003_050jul", "source_sha256": "2a269a50a42b7fa5a954f2adf46e03f935bd6b907684fa055c9eaa47c4b5f9a6", "ja": "……男物の水着……？\nなんだそれ。まさか、それを着ろってんじゃないよな？", "zh": "……男用泳装……？\n那是做什么的？该不会要叫我穿吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_050jul_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_050jul_2004_p", "source_sha256": "c13f2fbdf19e60177e77bfe96170936e8cc45b7dd976e187dc5d0dcdb9707555", "ja": "違う、俺もジュリアにつきあって、水着を着るんだ。\nひとりきりじゃなければ、恥ずかしくないだろ？", "zh": "不，是我也陪茱莉亚一起穿泳装。\n只要不是一个人穿，就不会害羞了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_050jul_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_050jul_2005_050jul", "source_sha256": "7ae2fff19431a1c5040d85c1364dec8a9b6b1fbc541da7b4c8aaaaaee5746cef", "ja": "いや……っていうか、なんで持ってきてるんだよ！？\nあんたは被写体じゃないってのに、ったく……ははっ。", "zh": "不……重点是，你为什么要带来啊！？\n又不是你要拍照，真是的……哈哈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_050jul_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_050jul_2006_050jul", "source_sha256": "9d43ad1e9772487cae2310d07a19c850afd75a15e7c56cd621543361157f70a0", "ja": "あんたがバカしてくれたおかげで、緊張が解けたよ。\n逃げるのもダサいからな……腹くくって、行ってくる！", "zh": "多亏了你耍笨，我心情放松多了。\n要是逃了也很难堪……我就咬牙上啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
